{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"Romack Home Maintenance Services (Rowmack Inc.) | 캘리포니아 바카빌 집수리 전문가","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">R</span><span>Romack Home Maintenance Services</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">소개</a><a href=\"#services\">서비스</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a><a href=\"#gallery\">사진</a><a href=\"#reviews\">리뷰</a><a href=\"#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">전화</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/cedar-steps.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">집수리 전문가 · 캘리포니아 바카빌 · Rowmack Inc.</p>\n    <h1>Romack Home Maintenance Services</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">다 해내는 집수리 전문가. Bob Mackert가 25년 넘는 경험으로 집 안의 수리, 설치, 목공 작업을 한 번에 하나씩 확실하게 해 드립니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · Google 리뷰 39개<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Bob에게 전화 또는 문자</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Romack%20Home%20Maintenance%20Services%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 지도</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">리뷰 39개, 평점 4.9★</a></li><li>25년 이상 경력</li><li>대부분 당일 답변</li><li>작업 후 깔끔하게 정리</li><li>신용카드 가능</li><li>토요일 영업</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Bob을 소개합니다</p><h2>한 번에 하나씩 확실하게.</h2><p>Romack Home Maintenance Services, 다른 이름으로 Rowmack Inc.는 바로 저, 바카빌의 집수리 전문가 Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert입니다. 25년 넘는 경험이 있고, 나무나 집과 관련된 일이라면 간단한 작업부터 맞춤 제작까지 할 수 있는 일이 아주 많습니다.</p><p>빠르게, 대부분 당일에 답변드리고, 약속 시간을 지키고, 정직한 가격을 받으며, 작업 후에는 깨끗이 정리합니다. 많은 고객분들이 집안일이 생길 때마다 다시 저를 찾아 주십니다.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>리뷰 39개</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>25년 이상</b><span>경력</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>월–토</b><span>주 6일 영업</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"난간이 있는 나무 현관 계단\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">서비스</p><h2>Bob이 하는 일</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>석고보드 및 텍스처</h3></div><p>석고보드 보수와 천장 텍스처 작업.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>문 설치 및 수리</h3></div><p>실내문, 현관문, 차고 옆문 설치, 조정, 수리.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>바닥 설치 및 수리</h3></div><p>강화마루와 걸레받이.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>가구 조립</h3></div><p>책상 등 각종 가구를 빠르게 조립.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>목공</h3></div><p>간단한 것부터 맞춤 제작까지 목공 작업.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>썩은 목재 제거 및 교체</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>코킹</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>배관 수리</h3></div><p>샤워 헤드 및 기타 수전 교체.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>설비 및 가전 설치</h3></div><p>천장 선풍기와 레인지 상부 전자레인지 설치, 기존 가전 수거.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">가격을 온라인에 올리지는 않지만, 항상 공정하고 합리적인 가격을 받습니다. (707) 317-8126으로 전화나 문자 주시면 작업 내용을 상의해 드립니다.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>알아 두실 점</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>신용카드 가능</b></li><li><b>빠른 답변</b><span>대부분 당일, 때로는 한 시간 안에</span></li><li><b>작업 공간 정리</b><span>작업이 끝나면 항상 정리합니다</span></li><li><b>기존 가전 수거</b></li><li><b>토요일 영업</b><span>오전 9시–오후 3시</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>최근 작업</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tile-shower.jpg\" alt=\"타일 샤워 벽\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fireplace-wall.jpg\" alt=\"돌로 마감한 벽난로 벽\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/deck-rebuild.jpg\" alt=\"시공 중인 나무 데크\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/treehouse-deck.jpg\" alt=\"높은 나무 데크\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shed.jpg\" alt=\"창고\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/garden-bench.jpg\" alt=\"나무 정원 벤치\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/laminate-floor.jpg\" alt=\"복도의 나무결 바닥\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"나무 현관 계단\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">대표</p><h2>Bob이 직접 드리는 말씀</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Handyman services, With the one project at a time attitude. laminate floor installation, Doors installed, With over 25 yrs experience, If your project involves wood and/or houses, My list of skills goes on, From simple to custom, You get what you want with Rowmack .inc Simply put, The handyman that can.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Robert Mackert, owner</b> · In Bob&#39;s words</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>고객 후기</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 39개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 리뷰 12개</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/rowmack-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“He is the best handyman I’ve ever hired. Very professional and kind. We are very satisfied.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I am absolutely thrilled to write a review for Robert, who recently installed a ceiling fan in my home. From start to finish, the experience was nothing short of exceptional. Robert is the epitome of professionalism. He arrived precisely on time, which I greatly appreciate, and immediately got to work. Beyond his punctuality, his demeanor was incredibly pleasant, and he even had a great sense of humor that made the whole process enjoyable. What truly set Robert apart was his keen eye and observant nature. He noticed a small detail about the wiring that could have caused an issue down the line…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My husband text Bob, today Sunday March 2, 2025 to replace a shower head in one of our bathrooms. Bob, responded immediately and said that he’d be out today, he arrived within the hour and replaced the shower head within a few minutes. He’s quick, reasonably priced and more importantly, he cleans up behind himself. We use Bob on a regular basis for various repairs around the house.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is very helpful, very affordable and upfront. I called and he showed up within an hour and a half. I had one project that I called him out for, but after having him look at the main project, I intend on using his services for all of my other projects that need to be taken care of.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I called ROWMACK today and spoke with Robert Mackert. I will be working from home starting tomorrow and my desk was still in the box!!! Bob came to my house and within an hour my desk was complete. He is also very nice. So if you need someone to put your furniture together, please call my new handy man at ROWMACK INC! Trust me, you will be glad you did!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Robert responded the same day. He arrived on time and went to work. Completed task in a reasonable time and charged a fair fee for a difficult job. Cleaned up his work area. I am very pleased and would not hesitate to hire him again.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Sep 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is an excellent worker. Shows up when he says he will and makes sure whatever he is working on is repaired correctly. We’ve had three different people work on our door, but they never fixed it. Bob put in the time to make sure it was done correctly. He is reasonable in his pricing and very kind. We will definitely be using his services in the future!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob of Rowmack Inc Handyman Services did a side garage door install. He knew exactly what was required to start and finish the project in a timely matter. His professional talent produced outstanding results. I am more than pleased with his work. I have already ask Bob to schedule me in for another install in the kitchen. Highly Recommended”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Such great service received today. I found Bob&#39;s information while searching for someone to install my over the range microwave. I reached out to Bob and he was very responsive and was able to get me all set up this morning. Bob even recommended an earlier time. I really can say what quality work and Bob hauled away the old appliance as well. I will recommend Bob to anyone and even make use of him again for other things needed to be done in my house. If I could have given 10 stars I would.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2021</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob knows his stuff! He did an awesome job installing our lament flooring and baseboards, he also was so fast at texturing my ceilings, and did some great electrical work for us. I love how flexible he is with our schedule and overall really fun to work with, I would highly recommend for any construction job!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Apr 2018</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Romack과 Rowmack Inc.는 같은 곳인가요?</summary><p>네, 둘 다 저입니다. 저는 Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert이고, 제 사업체는 Romack Home Maintenance Services와 Rowmack Inc. 두 이름으로 운영됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>어떤 작업을 하시나요?</summary><p>석고보드 보수와 텍스처, 문, 강화마루와 걸레받이, 가구 조립, 목공, 썩은 목재 보수, 코킹, 배관 수전 교체, 천장 선풍기와 가전 설치를 합니다. 나무나 집과 관련된 일이라면 편하게 물어보세요.</p></details><details><summary>얼마나 빨리 와 주실 수 있나요?</summary><p>대체로 빠릅니다. 보통 당일에 답변드리고, 한 시간이나 한 시간 반 안에 연락드릴 때도 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>비용은 얼마인가요?</summary><p>가격을 온라인에 올리지는 않지만, 공정하고 합리적이며 미리 투명하게 안내해 드립니다. (707) 317-8126으로 전화나 문자로 작업 내용을 알려 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>작업 시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월요일–금요일 오전 7시–오후 6시, 토요일 오전 9시–오후 3시에 일합니다. 일요일은 쉽니다.</p></details><details><summary>신용카드 받으시나요?</summary><p>네, 신용카드 받습니다.</p></details><details><summary>경력이 얼마나 되시나요?</summary><p>25년 넘는 경력이 있습니다.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">서비스 지역</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 서비스 지역</h2>\n      <address>서비스 지역: Vacaville, CA<br>Vacaville, CA 95687 소재</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">(707) 317-8126</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">방문 일정은 전화나 문자로 잡아 